# the entry that makes `this` for whoever constructs by value: the object is of one of the layouts that the tag picks, none of which has a field of the birth, so nothing is looked at behind the body
# RUN: walk f1:AllocatingConstructEntry mechanisms=all
# CHECK-LABEL: code f1:AllocatingConstructEntry
# CHECK: = NewObject
# RUN(NEVER): walk f1:AllocatingConstructEntry mechanisms=all
# NEVER-NOT: TryFinishBirth
# RUN(PLAIN): walk f1:AllocatingConstructEntry mechanisms=none
# PLAIN-NOT: TryFinishBirth
# PROGRAM-OF: ../typed-slots/new-with-a-known-tag-makes-the-member.ir
